  "description": "For some unknown reason, Eom Jae-yeong stopped aging when he turned nineteen. Kim Ra-bin, his girlfriend of fourteen years, begins to chase the truth he is desperately trying to hide. A missing SSD, and a recurring dream buried deep in her memories... As the pieces of the puzzle come together, the reality she has always believed in begins to shatter.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852783), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14463148)",
